ile the app is not\nnotarized yet."],[205,"The Hub is being built. Until it opens, install shards from any git\nrepository with `brok shard install <url>`."],[239,"The IDE is in English and Brazilian Portuguese. It starts in Portuguese on a\nPortuguese system; switch with **Language** on the home page."],[240,"The IDE talks to Brokspace only through the `brok` CLI and its JSON output\n(see Integrations), so it shows exactly what `brok`\nsees, and anything it does you can also do in a terminal. It needs brok\n0.2.4 or newer; the one it ships with qualifies."],[223,"The IDE updates itself from GitHub Releases. For answers you need an LLM:\nsee Local LLM setup (search works without one)."],[348,"the manifest's `build.command`, run in the repository;"],[760,"the manifest's `build.command`, run in the repository;"],[204,"The official home of shards, skills and agents for Brokspace."],[248,"The same workspace in an IDE built around it: a home page that starts\nwith your question, the Brokspace agent in the chat, search, reviews and\ncommit messages one click away."],[200,"the shared model cache: `~/.cache/brokspace` (Linux),\n`~/Library/Caches/brokspace` (macOS), `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\brokspace` (Windows);"],[612,"the shared model cache: `~/.cache/brokspace` (Linux),\n`~/Library/Caches/brokspace` (macOS), `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\brokspace` (Windows);"],[294,"The short version"],[706,"The short version"],[406,"The skill's instructions (and the reference files it links) become the\nsystem prompt; Brokspace adds relevant code from the index as context."],[818,"The skill's instructions (and the reference files it links) become the\nsystem prompt; Brokspace adds relevant code from the index as context."],[224,"The window starts minimal: Explorer, Search, Source Control and Brokspace on\nthe left, the **Brokspace agent** docked on the right. Debug, Testing and\nExtensions stay one shortcut away."],[198,"Then delete:"],[610,"Then delete:"],[196,"Then run `brok skill export` in your workspac